<p>Crude		38,000 (ULD)     Homi Baba		04/12</p>
<p>Petroleum</p>
<p> Products	     --- (LDD)     Shakti Doot	    03/12</p>
<p>Carbon Black</p>
<p> Feed Stock	 7,800 (ULD)     Shanghai		 04/12</p>
<p>Crude		41,000 (ULD)     R.N.Tagore	     05/12</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
